// Owner review notes for one TDD packet: copy to <packet>/eval/labels.jsonl (or pass --labels <file>). One JSON object per line;
// lines starting with // or # are ignored. Fields: target (artifact | packet | implementation | qa | bugs | tokens), anchor (an id on
// the page such as #d4, a file under agents/ such as agents/prs/pr-03.md, a PR such as PR 3, or "*" for the whole target), verdict
// (pass | fail | needs-work | question), note (what you saw, in your words), date (YYYY-MM-DD), author (optional). Each note becomes a
// label in input.json (labels.review_notes), the expected field of the target's Braintrust row, and the target's owner_review score
// (pass / (pass + fail + needs-work)). Delete these example lines before use.
